          ],
          "text": "Shikha Miglani",
          "_key": "k0133"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " (Saarthee). Ballew stressed the integration of data and design, while Miglani emphasized the importance of aligning AI solutions with customer needs. Nucci shared examples of using AI for internal discovery processes, highlighting how AI can connect disparate data points to create efficient workflows.",
          "_key": "k0134"
        }
      ],
