          "_key": "k0140"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0022"
          ],
          "text": "Jenna Kurath",
          "_key": "k0141"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " from Comcast and ",
          "_key": "k0142"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0023"
          ],
          "text": "Anthony Brock",
          "_key": "k0143"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " of the Flyers. They explored AI’s role in transforming sports marketing and fan engagement. Kurath discussed using AI to gain deeper insights into fan behavior, enabling personalized in-game and online experiences. Brock emphasized integrating GenAI with traditional models to provide actionable, real-time data, ensuring sports experiences are more impactful and engaging for fans.",
          "_key": "k0144"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0021",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/danhou/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0022",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/jennakurath/"
        },
        {
          "_key": "k0023",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/anthonydbrock/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0145",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Showcasing ventures: Innovators pitching the future",
          "_key": "k0146"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0147",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A standout element of the conference was the platform for emerging ventures to pitch their AI-driven innovations. These startups presented solutions addressing diverse challenges, such as enhancing supply chain efficiency and transforming educational technologies. This segment underscored the conference’s commitment to fostering innovation and supporting new voices in the AI space. The 2024 winner of the Venture Awards is ",
          "_key": "k0148"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0024"
          ],
          "text": "Sahay AI",
          "_key": "k0149"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ".",
          "_key": "k0150"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0024",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://sahayai.com/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0151",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Sahay AI leverages advanced AI to revolutionize railway inspections. Their AI models, real-time monitoring dashboard, and portable robots increase inspection speed by 10 times and reduce costs by 90%.",
          "_key": "k0152"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0153",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
